Compare a flight log with its simulation (not available yet)

Usage: hpr compare [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json          Print one JSON document on standard output instead of text; errors too
      --color <WHEN>  When to use color. Auto colors what goes to a terminal and heeds NO_COLOR, FORCE_COLOR and CLICOLOR_FORCE. JSON output never has color [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
  -h, --help          Print help
  -V, --version       Print version
